標，讓我們的用戶可以透過體育博彩、iGaming、DFS、數位彩票快遞和預測市場以及其他產品來找到樂趣和滿足感。我們也高度重視身為真錢遊戲新時代管理者的責任。我們的道德準則指導我們的決策，尊重體育的傳統和誠信，以及我們在監管合規和消費者保護方面的投資。"},{"en":"We continue to make deliberate and substantial investments in support of our mission and long-term growth. For example, we have invested in our product offerings and technology in order to continuously launch new product innovations; improve marketing, merchandising and operational efficiency through data science; and deliver a great user experience. We also make significant investments in sales and marketing and incentives to grow, retain, and monetize our paid user base, including personalized cross-product offers and promotions, and promote brand awareness to attract the \"skin-in-the-game\" sports fan. Together, these investments have enabled us to create a leading product built on scalable technology, while attracting a user base that has resulted in the rapid growth of our business.","zh":"我們繼續進行深思熟慮的大量投資，以支持我們的使命和長期成長。例如，我們對產品和技術進行投資，以不斷推出新產品創新；透過數據科學提高行銷、銷售和營運效率；並提供出色的用戶體驗。我們還在銷售和行銷以及激勵措施方面進行了大量投資，以擴大、保留和貨幣化我們的付費用戶群，包括個性化的跨產品優惠和促銷，並提高品牌知名度以吸引「身臨其境」的體育迷。這些投資使我們能夠創建基於可擴展技術的領先產品，同時吸引用戶群，從而導致我們業務的快速成長。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in the global entertainment and gaming industries, primarily with our Sportsbook, iGaming, DFS, and digital lottery courier product offerings, and the prediction markets industry, with our prediction markets product offering. Our users face a vast array of entertainment and engagement choices. Other forms of entertainment, such as television, movies, sporting events and in-person casinos, are more well established and may be perceived by our users to offer greater variety, affordability, interactivity and enjoyment. We compete with these and other forms of entertainment for the discretionary time and income of our users.","zh":"我們在全球娛樂和遊戲產業開展業務，主要提供體育博彩、iGaming、DFS 和數位彩票快遞產品，以及預測市場產業，主要提供預測市場產品。我們的用戶面臨著大量的娛樂和參與選擇。其他形式的娛樂，例如電視、電影、體育賽事和現場賭場，已經更加成熟，並且可能被我們的用戶認為提供了更多的多樣性、可負擔性、互動性和樂趣。我們與這些和其他形式的娛樂競爭，爭奪用戶的可支配時間和收入。"},{"en":"The specific industries in which we operate are characterized by dynamic customer demand and technological advances, and there is significant competition among online gaming and entertainment providers. A number of established, well-financed companies producing online gaming and/or interactive entertainment or prediction markets products and services compete with our product offerings, and other well-capitalized companies may introduce competitive services. There has also been consolidation among competitors in the entertainment and gaming industries, and such consolidation and future consolidation could result in the formation of larger competitors with increased financial resources and altered cost structures, which may","zh":"我們經營的特定行業的特點是客戶需求動態和技術進步，線上遊戲和娛樂供應商之間存在激烈競爭。許多生產線上遊戲和/或互動娛樂或預測市場產品和服務的資金雄厚的老牌公司與我們的產品競爭，而其他資本充足的公司可能會推出有競爭力的服務。娛樂和遊戲產業的競爭對手之間也出現了整合，這種整合和未來的整合可能會導致更大的競爭對手的形成，這些競爭對手的財務資源增加，成本結構發生變化，這可能會導致"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Sportsbook","val":3827091000,"zh":"體育博彩"},{"name":"I Gaming","val":1804613000,"zh":"我遊戲"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":422821000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"},{"name":"Product & Service Other Interest Income","val":25600000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他利息收入"}],"total":6054525000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":5895465000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":159060000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":6054525000}},"peers":["PENN","PTON","ABNB","RBLX","PINS"]}}